            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "theresa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good recipe! Like everyone else, I added 1 Tbs butter and some extra garlic. After the garlic and onions I added some frozen carrots and peas, just let them cook for about a min, they thaw fast. Then I added 1 egg and made sure it was cooked and well distributed before adding the rice. Turned out great! Everyone had seconds, didnt have any leftovers.",
            "datePublished": "2009-08-24T13:00:07.353Z"
          },
          {
