            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Danielle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I’ve made this 4 times and everyone always loves it. The only thing I do differently is to cook the rice the day before and store it in the fridge. Also, I prefer to use basmati rice because it doesn’t tend to get mushy with the second cook.",
            "datePublished": "2017-11-04T20:28:14.407Z"
          },
          {
