              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hilary Glaspy Duncan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made a few changes based on past experiences - I saute the onions, garlic &amp; rice in butter and THEN add the water. Because of what I served this time, I replaced the water with chicken broth &amp; a little bit of white wine. Turned out nice!",
